      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ5WxzN00BBDQRrPUHTYfwhoU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ1NHVQTVh3EAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "這是一家提供標準娛樂設施的酒吧，有台球、卡拉OK、飛鏢和啤酒乒乓。服務一般，沒什麼特別之處。提供花生、飲料和一些基本的熱食小吃，例如雞翅，不會出錯。這是一家適合在工作日晚上消磨時光的當地酒吧。我們去的那天，有人在室內抽煙。所以如果您不吸煙，請謹慎考慮。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "General bar with standard entertainment, pool, karaoke, darts and beer pong. Service is ok without much surprised. Peanuts, refreshment and some basic hot snacks like wings which cannot go wrong. A local bar where you can hang out on a regular weekday evening. On the day we went there were some people smoking cigarettes indoor. So consider it if you are a non-smoker.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Robert Lo",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111146214987047456054/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxbp9FsNTt2KzVwUhk_WyaoEKN_MWd9Q3xI9O29eFpJYlMJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
        },
        "publishTime": "2023-10-21T17:23:16.159079Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ1NHVQTVh3EAE&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ1NHVQTVh3EAE!2m1!1s0x3404014d37736ce5:0x8586f0874d07f5ac"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ5WxzN00BBDQRrPUHTYfwhoU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNmMi1qZkZ3EAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "這家酒吧創意十足，魅力四射，只有在香港才能感受到！卡拉OK音響設備令人驚喜，氛圍宜人，空間寬敞，服務人員熱情友好，充滿年輕人的活力。在香港的體驗非常棒，我強烈推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Creative and charming bar that can only be felt in Hong Kong! Surprised by karaoke sound facilities, pleasant atmosphere, spacious place, friendly and warm serving of young people. Have a great experience in Hong Kong. I definitely recommend it!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Lucky Itsme",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114704840628131455379/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYojnymuz09oNA7oAqD9zIubh_fPxoedlDXFtxPWb-cM_oQQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        "publishTime": "2025-03-22T21:51:29.628518Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNmMi1qZkZ3EAE&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNmMi1qZkZ3EAE!2m1!1s0x3404014d37736ce5:0x8586f0874d07f5ac"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ5WxzN00BBDQRrPUHTYfwhoU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfMkllM1dBEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡有台卡拉OK機，但是聲音太大了，我完全聽不到朋友的聲音……ㅠㅠ 工作人員非常友好，酒吧氛圍也不錯，但是卡拉OK機壞了。噪音大到我都分不清这里到底是酒吧还是卡拉OK酒吧了。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "노래방 기계 있는데 진짜 너무 시끄러워서 친구 목소리 아예 안 들림..ㅠㅠ 직원들은 엄청 친절하고 바 분위기 자체는 좋았음 근데 노래방 기계 미쳣음 걍 개시끄러움 심각함 술집인지 노래방인지 분간이 안 감",
          "languageCode": "ko"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
